  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1610.07 Doors",
  "priorExpiration": "2003-07-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1610.07 Doors.\n\n(a) All doors shall be constructed of 1/4 inch plate steel and lined with 2 inches of hardwood. Hinges and hasps shall be attached to the doors by welding, riveting, or by bolting with the nuts on the inside of the door.\n\n(b) The doors shall be installed in such a manner that the hinges and hasps cannot be removed when the doors are closed and locked.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-0; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
